---
description: Ignition gateway work through the ignition-gen-sdk `ign` CLI
alwaysApply: false
globs: ["config/resources/**", "projects/**", ".ign_tools/**"]
---
Older gateways without the `/data/api/v1` API are unsupported: if `gateway-info` returns 404, stop and tell the user. Skills live in
`.agents/skills/`; read only the one the task needs (`ignition-setup` for install and
connection only). If no `ign` verb covers a task, stop and report what is missing. Only the `ign`
CLI writes `config/resources/**` and `projects/**`. Never call the gateway with curl.
Project-specific learnings go in `.agents/skills/ignition-local/`.
